{'symbol': 'BDX', 'date': '2021-08-25 16:10:00', 'title': 'BD RECEIVES EMERGENCY USE AUTHORIZATION FOR FIRST AT-HOME COVID-19 TEST TO USE SMARTPHONE TO INTERPRET, DELIVER RESULTS', 'text': 'FRANKLIN LAKES, N.J., AUG. 25, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BD (BECTON, DICKINSON AND COMPANY) (NYSE: BDX), A LEADING GLOBAL MEDICAL TECHNOLOGY COMPANY,\xa0ANNOUNCED TODAY THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) HAS ISSUED AN EMERGENCY USE AUTHORIZATION (EUA) FOR THE BD VERITOR™ AT-HOME COVID-19 TEST — THE FIRST AT-HOME COVID-19 RAPID ANTIGEN TEST TO USE COMPUTER VISION TECHNOLOGY IN A SMARTPHONE TO INTERPRET AND PROVIDE A DIGITAL DISPLAY OF TESTING RESULTS.'}{'symbol': 'BDX', 'date': '2021-08-25 06:50:00', 'title': 'BD LAUNCHES FULLY AUTOMATED HIGH-THROUGHPUT MOLECULAR DIAGNOSTIC PLATFORM FOR U.S. LABORATORIES', 'text': 'FRANKLIN LAKES, N.J., AUG. 25, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BD (BECTON, DICKINSON AND COMPANY) (NYSE: BDX), A LEADING GLOBAL MEDICAL TECHNOLOGY COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS LAUNCHED A NEW, FULLY AUTOMATED HIGH-THROUGHPUT DIAGNOSTIC SYSTEM USING ROBOTICS AND SAMPLE MANAGEMENT SOFTWARE ALGORITHMS TO SET A NEW STANDARD IN AUTOMATION FOR INFECTIOUS DISEASE MOLECULAR TESTING IN CORE LABORATORIES AND OTHER CENTRALIZED LABORATORIES IN THE UNITED STATES.'}